？”“鸠儿想是什么？”宋雪衣反问灵鸠，看着女孩儿小小的身体蹲坐在浴池岸边，只是看着就觉得软软的嫩嫩的很好抱很好捏。以前怎么没有发现小孩这般可爱？还是说可爱的只有鸠儿一个而已。灵鸠脱口笑道：“姐姐。”宋雪衣一怔，紧接着双肩颤抖，双眼越眯越小，嘴角越扬越高，发出清朗的笑声，“哈哈，哈哈哈。”灵鸠一头黑线。果然，她不该放松警惕。门外，回到岗位的霞妍脸色闪过不可置信，不由的侧耳倾听，将笑声听得越发清晰后，眼神越发的惊疑不定。那个小女孩到底是什么身份，又有什么不得了的本事，竟然能让大少爷高兴成这样！宋雪衣笑着笑着就乐极生悲，转笑为咳嗽，饶是咳得辛苦，他的眉眼里还是溺满了愉悦。灵鸠早就伸手拍着他的背帮他顺气，边教道：“虽然我是挺喜欢看你笑的，不过乐极生悲就不好了。”她是真的喜欢看他开心，看他笑吧。宋雪衣想，否则怎么会被笑话了，也从来不阻止他的笑。“为什么？”脱口而出的问话。分明不曾相识的人，才见过几次面，就这么为他着想。“嗯？”灵鸠疑惑看去，对上一双浓深感情的眸子一怔，又不由躲避。宋雪衣摇头，见小孩视线已经不在自己身上，根本就看不见自己的动作，笑道：“鸠儿，你真好。”“……踹了你一脸脚印，这叫好？”灵鸠傻傻的说，一说完恨不得拍自己一巴掌。“好。”宋雪衣毫不犹豫道，“鸠儿不是问我，鸠儿是什么吗？”灵鸠很乐意他把话题转移，不过为什么又转到这个话题上？宋雪衣笑道：“鸠儿是独一无二的鸠儿。”灵鸠探上他的脉搏，摸着他脉象，道：“哪个人不是独一无二。”宋雪衣摇头，“鸠儿在我的心里独一无二，姐姐妹妹都不及鸠儿在我心中的十分之一。”灵鸠笑弯眉眼，“就冲你这句话，就算不枉我疼你了。”说着收回摸脉的手，眼中闪动着算计。从脉象来看似乎是先天不足，不过先天不足也不会惹来这么多邪灵入体，这里面有问题。宋雪衣笑而不语。灵鸠不知道，跟在宋雪衣身边的人，以及孙谷兰都知道，只要是宋雪衣说出来的话一定会做到，他说出的承诺也一定是真。他如今说灵鸠在他心中独一无二，那么他就是真的将灵鸠视为独一无二，比姐姐妹妹重要十倍百倍的人。思考中的灵鸠忽然感觉有人朝她伸手，本能的准备躲闪，又想起来这里只有她和宋雪衣，就硬生生僵住了躲避的动作，然后她就感觉腰身被人抱着，一下落入了温热的水中。在灵鸠还在愣神中，身上的仅剩的衣裳就被宋雪衣扒干净，直到头发被人摩擦，她神色一囧，看向宋雪衣，“你……”“一直呆在岸上会着凉。”宋雪衣轻声哄道，小心翼翼用香膏给她洗头发。“……”好舒服！灵鸠刚准备阻止，就觉得小脑袋被一只手揉捏得舒服得不得了，鼻尖是淡淡怡人的药香味，一瞬懒性子又冒出来了。算了，算了，再享受一会儿，之后的事之后再说。宋雪衣抿着笑，看着怀里的女孩儿眯着双眼睛，神情慵懒享受得跟猫儿似的，笑语呢喃，“说什么做婢女，分明就是让人伺候的性子，哪里会伺候人。”“嗯？”凉凉的糯糯的鼻音。宋雪衣哄道：“没事，可舒服？”“嗯嗯。”真心舒服……哪个理发店洗头工技术有这么好？呃！我去！灵鸠猝然睁大眼睛，看到宋雪衣的脸，再环顾四方，发现她已经不在浴池里，反而站在铺着毛垫的长榻上。“沐浴的香膏有安神的作用，鸠儿刚刚睡迷糊了。”宋雪衣为她解惑。灵鸠闻言愣愣的将视线收回宋雪衣的身上，发现他正拿着一件稍显宽大的衣裳往自己的身上披。这时候她总算看清自己的状态，红了一张脸。靠！居然赤身**的站在别人的面前！宋雪衣发现她的异样，沉吟了一秒后悟了，笑道：“鸠儿害羞？”“害羞你妹。”灵鸠木然说道，夺了他手里的白衣穿上，眼看着长了手臂和脚裸大段的衣服一阵无语。宋雪衣又取了蔚蓝色的外衣给她穿戴，道：“鸠儿似很在意我妹？”“……我错了，你妹何其无辜。”灵鸠本能的抬抬手，把手套进他拿过来的袖子里。宋雪衣闻言动作一顿，低声道：“我希望鸠儿在意的只有我。”灵鸠诧异的抬眸，又听到宋雪衣道：“至少在我身边的时间里，只在意我一人，不要把过多的感情和目光放在别人的身上。”“你以为天底下能有多少个像你这样的人？”灵鸠受不了的伸手捧住宋雪衣的脸，这人分明没有摆出难过的表情，却比悲痛欲绝还要叫人揪心，用淡静宁和的神情请求，一点压迫和威胁都没有。“还是你以为我是圣母啊，见人就同情心泛滥？”宋雪衣眸光一闪，没有说话。灵鸠忽然认真道：“宋雪衣，我并不是好人，真的。”“我便当你答应了。”宋雪衣笑着道，又伸手将榻上的人儿抱起来。灵鸠后知后觉自己似乎被坑了，蹬了蹬脚，就感觉到宋雪衣停下步伐，问道：“要踢人了吗？”“我觉得看错你了。”灵鸠无语道。宋雪衣低笑，“鸠儿，我也不如你看到那么好，真的。”灵鸠不置可否。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/qingbenheimengzhiyaofeilaixi/9.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 009 Overcoming Your Defense After helping Song Xueyi wipe away the nosebleed, Lingjiu took the initiative to help him take off his clothes. Song Xueyi stopped him, \"Help Jiuer wash first.\" Lingjiu glared at him, \"Who is the young master and who is the maid?\" Although she didn't really want to be a maid, she could still do it on the surface. If Lingjiu was a little repulsive at first, then with Song Xueyi's continuous coughing and pitiful appearance of nosebleeds, that awkwardness had long since disappeared without a trace. They are just a thirteen-year-old boy, and she is only seven years old now. Taking a bath together is nothing. She obviously didn't think too much about it, but she was really evil if she thought too much. I had even seen naked men in my previous life, so what was there to fear about a young man's body? Lingjiu obviously didn't realize that her focus had been completely distorted. This was not a question of whether she was afraid or not, but a question of whether she was willing or not. \"Jiu'er is not a maid.\" After Song Xueyi took off his clothes, his skin touched the air, and it was so cold that he felt a slight tremor in his voice. Lingjiu hurriedly pulled him into the bathtub where the hot water was placed. When he lowered his head, he saw that his shoes were making the ground dirty. He took off his shoes and socks without realizing it, and asked Song Xueyi casually, \"What is she if she's not a maid?\" Why haven't I found children so cute before? Or is it just Jiu'er who is cute? Lingjiu blurted out with a smile: \"Sister.\" Song Xueyi was startled, then her shoulders trembled, her eyes narrowed and became smaller, the corners of her mouth raised higher and higher, and she let out a clear laugh, \"Haha, hahaha.\" Lingjiu had a black line on his head. Sure enough, she shouldn't let down her guard. Outside the door, Xia Yan, who had returned to her post, had a look of disbelief on her face. She couldn't help but listen attentively. After hearing the laughter more clearly, her eyes became more and more uncertain. Who is that little girl and what incredible abilities does she have that can make the young master so happy? Song Xueyi smiled and laughed, her happiness turned into sadness, and her laughter turned into coughing. Even though it was hard to cough, his brows and eyes were still full of joy. Lingjiu had already reached out and patted his back to help him calm down, while teaching him: \"Although I really like to see you smile, it's not good to be so happy that you become sad.\" She really likes to see him happy, see him smile. Song Xueyi thought, otherwise how could he be laughed at, and she never stopped him from laughing. \"Why?\" he blurted out the question. It was clear that he was someone who had never met before, and had only met a few times, yet he was so considerate of him. \"Huh?\" Lingjiu looked confused, and was startled when he saw a pair of deeply emotional eyes, but couldn't help but avoid them. Song Xueyi shook her head, seeing that the child's eyes were no longer on her, and could not see her movements at all, she smiled and said: \"Jiu'er, you are so kind.\" \"...I kicked your footprints all over your face. Is that okay?\" Lingjiu said stupidly, wanting to slap herself in the face as soon as she finished speaking. \"Okay.\" Song Xueyi said without hesitation, \"Didn't Jiu'er ask me, what is Jiu'er?\" Lingjiu was happy for him to change the topic, but why did he switch to this topic again? Song Xueyi smiled and said, \"Jiu'er is the unique Jiu'er.\" Lingjiu felt his pulse and said, \"Who is not unique?\" Song Xueyi shook his head, \"Jiu'er is the only one in my heart. No two, my sister is not even one-tenth as good as Jiu'er in my heart.\" Lingjiu smiled and frowned, \"Just say this to you, even if I love you in vain,\" he said with a calculating hand flashing in his eyes. Judging from the pulse, it seems to be a congenital deficiency, but congenital deficiencies will not cause so many evil spirits to enter the body. There is a problem here. Song Xueyi smiled and said nothing. Lingjiu didn't know that the people around Song Xueyi, as well as Sun Gulan, knew that as long as Song Xueyi said it, he would definitely do it, and the promise he made must be true. Now that he says that Lingjiu is unique in his heart, then he really regards Lingjiu as unique and ten times more important than his elder sister. Lingjiu, who was thinking, suddenly felt someone reaching out towards her, and instinctively prepared to dodge. Then she remembered that she and Song Xueyi were the only ones here, so she froze in her dodge action. Then she felt someone holding her waist and fell into the warm water. While Lingjiu was still dazed, Song Xueyi stripped off the remaining clothes on her body until her hair was rubbed by someone. She looked embarrassed and looked at Song Xueyi, \"You...\" \"You will catch a cold if you stay on the shore.\" Song Xueyi coaxed softly, carefully washing her hair with balm. \"...\" So comfortable! Just as Lingjiu was about to stop him, he felt that his little head was being kneaded by a hand and felt extremely comfortable. There was a light and pleasant medicinal fragrance on the tip of his nose, and his laziness suddenly emerged again. Forget it, forget it, enjoy it for a while longer and talk about the rest later. Song Xueyi smiled, looking at the girl in her arms who squinted her eyes, looking as lazy and enjoying herself as a cat, and murmured with a smile, \"When it comes to being a maid, she obviously has the temperament to serve others. How can she serve others.\" \"Huh?\" A cool and waxy nasal voice. Song Xueyi coaxed: \"It's okay, are you comfortable?\" \"Yeah, yeah.\" It feels really comfortable... Which barber shop has such good hair washing skills? Well! I'm going! Lingjiu suddenly opened his eyes wide and saw Song Xueyi's face. Then he looked around and found that she was no longer in the bathtub, but instead standing on a couch covered with fur cushions. \"The balm in the bath has a soothing effect. Jiu'er just fell asleep.\" Song Xueyi explained her confusion. Hearing this, Lingjiu turned his gaze back to Song Xueyi in a daze and found that he was taking a slightly looser piece of clothing and putting it on her body. At this time, she finally saw her state clearly and blushed. Depend on! Actually standing naked in front of others! Song Xueyi noticed something strange about her. She pondered for a second and then realized it. She smiled and said, \"Jiu'er is shy?\" \"Shy of your sister.\" Ling Jiu said numbly.", "title_en": "Chapter 9"}